# Public build-time configuration (Vite envDir, docs/PLAN.md §9.5-1).
# Committed on purpose: every value here ships to the browser anyway.
# NEVER put a secret here — secrets go to .dev.vars / `wrangler secret put`.

# Canonical origin: canonical / og:url / sitemap / JSON-LD (no trailing slash).
VITE_SITE_URL=https://shogigo.com
# お問い合わせ address. Empty = no /contact page and no footer link.
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=hi@shogigo.com
# Source code of this site (GPL-3.0-only: linked from every page).
VITE_SOURCE_URL=https://github.com/wanglin1329/shogigo
# Plausible script URL for this site. Empty = no analytics script.
# Setting it changes /privacy (analytics + 外部送信): bump LASTMOD['/privacy'] too.
VITE_PLAUSIBLE_SRC=
